('Overhead Press',         'strength', ARRAY['deltoids','triceps','upper traps'],      'barbell',   'Shoulder girdle integrity for high swim volume. Protects rotator cuff under fatigue.', 'Bar at collarbone. Brace core, press vertically overhead. Full lockout. Lower under control.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Barbell_Shoulder_Press/0.jpg', 'image', true),
