-- Core / stability
('Pallof Press',               'strength', ARRAY['obliques','transverse abdominis','glutes'], 'cable',     'Anti-rotation core stability — underpins efficient power transfer in all three disciplines.', 'Cable at chest height, stand sideways. Press straight out and hold 2s, resist rotation. Return slowly.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Barbell_Seated_Calf_Raise/0.jpg', 'image', true),
('Copenhagen Adductor Hold',   'strength', ARRAY['adductors','hip flexors'],                 'bodyweight', 'Hip adductor loading prevents groin injuries that frequently derail run-heavy training blocks.', 'Top leg on bench, bottom leg hanging. Lift bottom leg to meet top leg. Hold 3–5s, lower.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Adductor/0.jpg', 'image', true),
('Dead Bug',                   'strength', ARRAY['transverse abdominis','diaphragm','hip flexors'], 'none', 'Lumbar spine stability under contralateral limb movement — directly transfers to all three sports.', 'Lying on back, arms straight up, knees 90°. Slowly lower opposite arm/leg. Breathe throughout. Keep low back flat.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Dead_Bug/0.jpg', 'image', true);
